{
  "$schema": "../../schemas/users.schema.json",
  "comment": [
    "Source of truth for account metadata and age-tier placement.",
    "No dates of birth or other personal data are stored here - only the tier a person belongs to.",
    "Accounts are NOT created by this repository; they already exist in the tenant.",
    "This file drives static membership of the tier security groups in groups.json.",
    "Where an age tier has not been confirmed by a tenant owner, the account is placed in the",
    "MOST restrictive tier that still fits ('child') and ageTierConfirmed is set to false.",
    "Loosening a tier is a deliberate, reviewable change - never a default."
  ],
